OpenCluely
Original project: TechyCSR/OpenCluely
https://github.com/TechyCSR/OpenCluely

This repository contains a modified source distribution maintained by Afnan Mehmood Awan.
Local additions include the Markdown call-brief workflow, local Ollama integration,
streaming Whisper worker, BlackHole audio path, and related reliability work.
The original Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE. Existing third-party
notices within source and bundled libraries are retained. Package metadata has
been aligned with the supplied LICENSE file.

Publication edits: private runtime files/history/builds omitted; sample-only
fixtures retained; personal default vocabulary removed; public documentation
and repository metadata added. This is an independent modified distribution,
not an official Cluely product.
